  "details": "I noticed that the language options in the personal profile include various regional dialects such as 官話(Mandarin), 潮州話(Teochew), 吳語(Wu), and 廣東話(Cantonese). Therefore, I would like to propose adding「台語」(Taiwanese) as a regional dialect of Taiwan and「國語」(Taiwanese Mandarin) as the official language of Taiwan, as their number of speakers is comparable to the languages already listed.",
